title: "AFOS Brazil 2026 Electoral Divergence Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Open, auditable dataset cross-referencing prediction markets (Polymarket),
  TSE-registered electoral polls and press coverage for Brazil's 2026
  presidential election, with explicit market-versus-poll divergence rather
  than smoothed averages. Includes the official TSE poll registry, published
  national poll results for both rounds, the Polymarket price series, the
  divergence series, the official TSE result of the first round (2026-10-04)
  and the runoff (2026-10-25), the two election nights, and the AFOS closing
  report in Portuguese, English and Spanish. Closed on 2026-11-01.
